& Pain Management\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nEmergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiation Oncology\nRadiology\nSocial Work\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nPrevious Slide\nNext Slide\nComprehensive and Compassionate Care for Salt Lake City Pets Every Day of the Year\nMedVet Salt Lake City is home to the most advanced 24-hour emergency, critical care, and specialty pet care in the Salt Lake City area, and broader Weber, Davis, Morgan, and Summit County communities. Our comprehensive care is an extension of your family veterinarian. As part of our advanced veterinary care, we offer life-saving treatments for your pets including\ndialysis\n.\nServing thousands of patients a year, our team is a trusted partner in care for family veterinarians and pet lovers. We know pets are an important part of your family, and we strive to provide exceptional care while showing compassion for you and your pet. Our team has the expertise and the resources in our state-of-the-art facility to diagnose and treat your pet, giving them the best chance for a positive outcome.\nWe know pets are family! While our healthcare teams provide medical care for each pet who walks through our hospital doors, our\nVeterinary Social Work\nteam supports the people and families who love them.\nIf your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital 24/7/365 – no appointment is needed.\nMedVet Salt Lake City Caregivers\nSearch by Name\nFilter by Specialty\nAll Specialties\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nEmergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiation Oncology\nRadiology\nSocial Work\nSurgery\nOur Hospital Leaders\nElliot Williams, DVM\nMedical Director\nAmanda Hemp\nHospital Director\nOur Doctors\nAlejandra Alegria\n,  DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nTony Bieser\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nBrie Brown\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKatie  Dawson\n, DVM, DACVECC\nCritical Care, Emergency Medicine\nSarah R. B. DeSpain\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAlexandra DeStefano\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nDervla Doherty\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKristopher Doyle\n, DVM\nRadiology\nAngela Gorney\n, DVM, DACVR\nRadiology\nKayla  Grint\n, DVM, DACVIM (Cardiology)\nCardiology\nHeather Hamblin\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMatthew D. Harjes\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMadeline Hileman\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nJessica Im\n, DVM\nRadiology\nGrayson Clay Johnson\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nTeresa Kaiser\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nLiz Lee\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nSylvia Lee\n, DVM, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nKervans Lerouge\n, DVM\nRadiology\nMichelle Miller\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nTrish E. Paulos\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (Oncology)\nMedical Oncology\nRennie  Putnam\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nChristine Qui\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nJaycie  Riesberg\n, DVM, DACVO\n®\nOphthalmology\nJordan Scherk\n, DVM, DACVECC\nEmergency Medicine, Critical Care\nGeoff Simons\n, MSW, CSW-UT\nSocial Work\nAngelina Smith\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nDainna Stelmach\n, DVM, MS, DACVR\nRadiology\nDanielle E. Strahl-Heldreth\n, DVM, MSEd, MSVMS, CVA, DACVAA\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nMegan Tischbein\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nErin Trageser\n, DVM, MS, DACVR (Radiation Oncology)\nRadiation Oncology\nElliot Williams\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nHilary Wright\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (Neurology)\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nKatie Wright\n, DVM, DACVIM\nMedical Oncology\nLindsay Wright\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nShow All Doctors (\n35\n)\nPet Stories\n“\nMedVet saved my Great Dane’s life; he didn’t have a good chance of surviving. We arrived at 3am and the team was waiting. They immediately got him into surgery and constantly updated me on his progress. Bloat kills most dogs within hours. He’s home doing great!”\nPrevious Story\nNext Story\nFinancing Options\nWe understand that planning for the cost of care is important. Special financing and payment arrangements are available for qualified pet owners through an independent company, CareCredit.\nLearn More\nFind a location\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nFind a Location\nFind A Doctor\nResources\nPet Care Resources\nClinical Studies\nAbout\nWe Are MedVet\nMedVet Experience\nOur Leaders\nOur Founders\nNewsroom\nDiversity, Inclusion, & Belonging\nCommunity Support\nFAQs\nContact Us\nFor Veterinarians\nClinical Studies\nContinuing Education\nCareers\nMedVet Open Positions at New Hospitals\nMedVet Training Programs\nSpecialties\nSpecialties Overview\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nAvian & Exotics\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nDermatology\nEmergency Medicine\nIntegrative Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nInterventional Radiology\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiation Oncology\nRadiology\nRehabilitation\nSports Medicine\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nSocial\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nFacebook\nYouTube\nPartners\nVetRad\nVeterinary Eye Institute\nMedVet Suppliers\nLegal\nPrivacy Policy\nCA Privacy\nYour Privacy Choices\nTerms\nTransparency in Coverage\nTax Information",
