      "address": "331 W. Bearcat Dr., Salt Lake City, UT 84115",
      "description": "Comprehensive and Compassionate Care for Salt Lake City Pets Every Day of the Year MedVet Salt Lake City is home to the most advanced 24-hour emergency, critical care, and specialty pet care in the Salt Lake City area, and broader Weber, Davis, Morgan, and Summit County communities. Our comprehensive care is an extension of your family veterinarian. As part of our advanced veterinary care, we offer life-saving treatments for your pets including dialysis. Serving thousands of patients a year, our team is a trusted partner in care for family veterinarians and pet lovers. We know pets are an important part of your family, and we strive to provide exceptional care while showing compassion for you and your pet. Our team has the expertise and the resources in our state-of-the-art facility to diagnose and treat your pet, giving them the best chance for a positive outcome. We know pets are family! While our healthcare teams provide medical care for each pet who walks through our hospital doors, our Veterinary Social Work team supports the people and families who love them. If your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital 24/7/365 – no appointment is needed.",
